# PisoCheck holds no keys in the repo.
#
# The extension reads its TypeSafe API key from chrome.storage (set it in the options
# page), and the optional proxy reads it from a Cloudflare Worker secret:
#
#   wrangler secret put TYPESAFE_API_KEY
#
# Get a key at https://console.typesafe.ai/settings/keys
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=
